{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","灾厄释放"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","潘多拉释放魔盒中的灾祸，不分敌我地影响除自己以外的所有角色。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","潘多拉的魔盒中存有灾祸和希望，被动地，潘多拉自身受到希望的庇护，不受本技能效果影响。主动释放时，潘多拉打开魔盒释放其中的灾祸，使场上所有角色向所属阵营方向恐惧5秒，并在此期间每0.5秒流失50% + 5% ATK的生命值。恐惧效果结束后受其影响角色的攻击力将下降10%，持续8秒，最多叠加3次。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":97,"end":102,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":77,"end":79,"tooltip_key":"keyword:fear"},{"start":94,"end":106,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":111,"end":113,"tooltip_key":"keyword:fear"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","每0.5秒流失的生命值提升至55% + 5% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每0.5秒流失的生命值提升至60% + 5% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","每0.5秒流失的生命值提升至65% + 5% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","每0.5秒流失的生命值提升至70% + 5% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","魔盒庇护"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时将友军吸入魔盒，为其恢复能量。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，将最靠后的一名友军吸入魔盒中，使其处于无敌状态，但无法释放任何技能。经过4秒后，将其从魔盒内放出。若放出该友军时潘多拉依然存活，则该名友军获得1000点能量，并在接下来10秒内攻击力增加35% + 5%。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":102,"end":107,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":10,"tooltip_key":"keyword:backest"},{"start":25,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"keyword:invincible"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","友军攻击力提升幅度增加至40% + 5%。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","友军攻击力提升幅度增加至45% + 5%。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","友军攻击力提升幅度增加至50% + 5%。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","致命侵蚀"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","潘多拉受到魔盒的“侵蚀”，根据“侵蚀”层数对敌人施加负面效果。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动地，潘多拉每次释放普通攻击以外的技能时，为从魔盒中放出的友军恢复290% + 25% ATK生命值和90 + 10点能量，同时魔盒会因此释放“侵蚀”，使潘多拉和随机一名未被“侵蚀”的敌人受到伤害永久提升10%，潘多拉自身的“侵蚀”最多叠加4次，敌人的“侵蚀”不可叠加。\n主动释放时，潘多拉使随机一名敌人在接下来10秒内随机获得以下若干种负面效果（负面效果的施加数量等同于潘多拉自身的“侵蚀”层数）：急速下降45点、回能效率下降45%、受愈下降45点、普通攻击有45%的概率落空。这些负面效果均不可叠加，优先对未被此主动释放效果影响的敌人释放。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":38,"end":44,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg7"},{"start":54,"end":59,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":34,"end":48,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","为友军的恢复提升至300% + 25% ATK生命值和100 + 10点能量。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":19,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg7"},{"start":30,"end":35,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","为友军的恢复提升至310% + 25% ATK生命值和110 + 10点能量。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":19,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg7"},{"start":30,"end":35,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","为友军的恢复提升至320% + 25% ATK生命值和120 + 10点能量。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":19,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg7"},{"start":30,"end":35,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗中，最大生命值提升，受到魔盒的侵蚀后则进一步提升最大生命值。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身最大生命值提升12%，受到魔盒的侵蚀后额外提升6%。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身最大生命值提升18%，受到魔盒的侵蚀后额外提升9%。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身最大生命值提升24%，受到魔盒的侵蚀后额外提升12%。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","不弃之礼"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","魔盒在潘多拉被击败后继续留在场上，无法被摧毁。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","自身被击败后魔盒可留在场上，魔盒不会被优先选为目标，处于霸体状态且不可摧毁，拥有1000点能量上限，每秒恢复45点能量，能量满时，魔盒会再次释放终极技能“灾厄释放”，但不再产生生命流失效果。每隔5秒，魔盒对随机一名敌人释放“致命侵蚀”，但只会随机选择一种负面效果。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","魔盒每秒恢复的能量提升至55点。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","终极技能“灾厄释放”产生的攻击力下降效果对敌方的持续时间变为永久。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","魔盒每秒恢复的能量提升至65点。"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","放入魔盒的友军不受潘多拉终极技能的影响。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","放入魔盒的友军永久获得希望的庇护，不受技能“灾厄释放”的效果影响，本效果在潘多拉被击败后依旧生效。"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","虚空之匣"]]}